// owner 解析:file#symbol —— 文件必须存在,符号必须真的定义在那(缺符号=登记表烂了,不是"没重复")。
export function resolveOwner(root, owner) {
  const i = String(owner ?? '').indexOf('#')
  if (i <= 0) return { ok: false, why: `owner 必须写成 file#symbol,收到 ${JSON.stringify(owner)}` }
  const rel = owner.slice(0, i), sym = owner.slice(i + 1)
  const abs = path.join(root, rel)
  if (!fs.existsSync(abs)) return { ok: false, why: `owner 文件不存在: ${rel}` }
  const src = fs.readFileSync(abs, 'utf8')
  if (rel.endsWith('.json')) {
    let cur
    try { cur = JSON.parse(src) } catch (e) { return { ok: false, why: `${rel} 不是合法 JSON(${e.message})` } }
    for (const seg of sym.split('.')) {
      if (cur && typeof cur === 'object' && seg in cur) { cur = cur[seg]; continue }
      return { ok: false, why: `JSON 路径 ${sym} 在 ${rel} 里解析不到(缺 "${seg}")` }
    }
    return { ok: true, kind: 'json' }
  }
  const name = sym.replace(/[.*+?^${}()|[\]\\]/g, '\\$&')
  const re = new RegExp(`(^|\\n)[ \\t]*(export[ \\t]+)?(async[ \\t]+)?(function|const|let|var|class)[ \\t]+${name}\\b`)
  if (!re.test(src)) return { ok: false, why: `符号 ${sym} 在 ${rel} 里找不到定义(function|const|class)` }
  return { ok: true, kind: 'code' }
}

// 在册文件 = 全仓减去 scan.skipDirs / scan.skipFilePatterns,只留 scan.extensions 里的文本后缀。
export function inScopeFiles(root, scan = {}) {
  const skip = scan.skipDirs ?? []
  const skipFile = (scan.skipFilePatterns ?? []).map((p) => new RegExp(p))
  const exts = new Set(scan.extensions ?? [])
  const out = []
  const walk = (d) => {
    let entries = []
    try { entries = fs.readdirSync(d, { withFileTypes: true }) } catch { return }
    for (const e of entries) {
      const abs = path.join(d, e.name)
      const rel = path.relative(root, abs).split(path.sep).join('/')
      if (skip.some((s) => rel === s || rel.startsWith(s + '/'))) continue
      if (e.isDirectory()) { walk(abs); continue }
      if (!exts.has(path.extname(e.name)) || skipFile.some((r) => r.test(rel))) continue
      out.push(rel)
    }
  }
